 a light wooden counter in the foreground with a white tablet point-of-sale screen on a white stand at center right and a latte in a white cup and saucer at lower left, a white espresso machine at left, a blender at right, open shelves of wine bottles and stemmed glasses on a pale tiled wall, and a small white-blue neon bow sign at upper left, in soft, even, warm daylight. One locked-off camera at chest height frames the performer from mid-thigh up, centered behind the counter. <Subject 1> lowers her head toward the tablet and taps the screen with both hands, hair falling over her shoulders, eyes downcast, expression calm.\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.062, a hard jump cut on the identical framing; <Subject 1> leans forward over the counter with her left forearm resting on the wood beside the tablet and her right hand cupped under her chin, head tilted to her right, eyes lowered toward the screen with a gentle smile, swaying very slightly.\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.125, a hard jump cut on the identical framing; <Subject 1> stands upright and touches the top of her head with her right hand, face tilted downward.\nAt 00:04.500, <Subject 1> slides her right hand back and raises her arm behind her head, lifting her face toward the camera.\nAt 00:05.218, <Subject 1> looks straight into the lens with her arm still raised and breaks into a soft smile, holding it until the final frame.\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet café room tone with a faint hum from the espresso machine, soft fingertip taps on the tablet screen, and light fabric and hair rustle.\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 57, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [62], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "frame_count", "links": [75], "label": "帧计数", "t